I have noticed a bug using the 'unofficial official' MSC binaries from wuarchive
involving digging thigs.  Rock moles and dwarves (and dwarf lords, etc) are
sometimes invisible for no apparent reason.  They are NOT zapping themselves
with wands.  It may happen (to dwarves, anyway) when they wield a pick-axe.  
At least once, I saw a dwarf coming towards me, it wielded a pick axe, and then
it was invisible.  When I hit it, however, it just said I hit the dwarf (not
'it' or 'the invisible dwarf').  I'm pretty sure about this last point, but
I'm not positive....

